@startuml Authentication Flow
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant Client
participant "API Server" as API
database PostgreSQL as PG

== Login ==

User -> Client: login(email, password)
Client -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> PG: find user by email
PG --> API: user + password_hash
API -> API: bcrypt verify
API -> API: generate JWT tokens
API --> Client: Set-Cookie: access_token (15m)\nSet-Cookie: refresh_token (7d)
Client -> API: GET /auth/me\nCookie: access_token
API -> API: verify JWT
API -> PG: load user + roles + permissions
API --> Client: MeResponse

== Token Refresh (after 15 min) ==

Client -> API: API request\nCookie: access_token (expired)
API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized

Client -> Client: queue failed request
Client -> API: POST /auth/refresh\nCookie: refresh_token
API -> API: verify refresh token
API --> Client: Set-Cookie: new access_token

Client -> API: retry queued request\nCookie: new access_token
API --> Client: 200 OK

note right of Client
  On refresh failure:
  redirect to /logout
end note
@enduml
